    <bf:note>
      <bf:Note>
	<rdfs:label>Facsimile and modern edition of a lute tablature compiled in southwest Germany in the early 17th century, preserved in the Kunstkabinett der Stiftsbibliothek St. Paul im Lavanttal (shelf mark: A-SPL KK 35).</rdfs:label>
      </bf:Note>
    </bf:note>
